<title>USA: Aspect Telecom sets 2-for-1 stock split.</title>
<headline>Aspect Telecom sets 2-for-1 stock split.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, Calif. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Aspect Telecommunications Corp said Friday its board had approved a two-for-one stock split, payable on or about January 28, record January 6.</p>
<p>Aspect said it will have about 49 million shares outstanding after the split.</p>
